Source: localsend
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/localsend/localsend

Package: localsend
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libatk1.0-0t64, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libayatana-ido3-0.4-0, libayatana-indicator3-7, libcairo2, libdbusmenu-glib4, libepoxy0, libfontconfig1, libgcc-s1, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libharfbuzz0b, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libstdc++6, xdg-user-dirs
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Open source cross-platform alternative to AirDrop
 LocalSend is a free, open-source app that enables secure communication
 between devices using a REST API and HTTPS encryption.
